<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Partner With Us — OzarkRoost</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Earn commissions referring Arkansas Ozarks cabin and campground operators to OzarkRoost. No cost to join.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav class="site-nav">
    <div class="site-nav__inner">
      <a href="/" class="site-nav__logo">OzarkRoost</a>
      <div class="site-nav__links">
        <a href="/listings">Browse Cabins</a>
        <a href="/adventures">Adventures</a>
        <a href="/list-your-cabin" class="site-nav__cta">List Your Cabin</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ref-hero">
    <div class="ref-hero__inner">
      <div class="ref-hero__badge">Operator Referral Program</div>
      <h1>Earn while you help the Ozarks thrive</h1>
      <p class="ref-hero__sub">Refer cabin and campground operators to OzarkRoost and earn commissions on every booking they receive — at no cost to you.</p>
      <div class="ref-hero__actions">
        <a href="#referral-form" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Become a Partner</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Earn Section -->
  <section class="ref-earn">
    <div class="ref-earn__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Two ways to earn</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">No membership fees. No commitments. Just revenue share on real bookings.</p>
      <div class="ref-earn__cards">
        <div class="ref-earn__card">
          <div class="ref-earn__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Affiliate Commissions</h3>
          <p>Earn a percentage of every booking made through OzarkRoost links on your site or content. We track everything — you get paid monthly.</p>
          <div class="ref-earn__rate">Up to <strong>8%</strong> per booking</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-earn__card ref-earn__card--highlight">
          <div class="ref-earn__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Cabin Referral Fees</h3>
          <p>Refer an operator who joins OzarkRoost's sponsored listing program. One-time bounty per active referral.</p>
          <div class="ref-earn__rate"><strong>$75</strong> per verified referral</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="ref-how" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="ref-how__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">How to get started</h2>
      <div class="ref-how__steps">
        <div class="ref-how__step">
          <div class="ref-how__step-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"/><path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Apply online</h3>
          <p>Fill out the form below with your info and how you plan to promote OzarkRoost. Takes 2 minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-how__step">
          <div class="ref-how__step-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>We approve &amp; activate</h3>
          <p>We review your application and set you up with your unique referral code and affiliate link within 48 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-how__step">
          <div class="ref-how__step-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Track &amp; get paid</h3>
          <p>Access your dashboard to see clicks, bookings, and commissions. Payments sent monthly via PayPal or direct deposit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who It's For -->
  <section class="ref-who">
    <div class="ref-who__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Built for the Ozarks community</h2>
      <div class="ref-who__list">
        <div class="ref-who__item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span><strong>Tourism boards &amp; CVBs</strong> — recommend OzarkRoost as a booking resource</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-who__item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span><strong>Outfitters &amp; guides</strong> — earn on cabins you recommend to fishing &amp; hiking clients</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-who__item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span><strong>Local blogs &amp; travel media</strong> — monetize your Ozarks content with booking links</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-who__item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span><strong>Real estate &amp; property managers</strong> — referral fees for every operator you bring on</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-who__item">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          <span><strong>Social media creators</strong> — affiliate links in your Ozarks travel content</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Referral Form -->
  <section class="ref-form-section" id="referral-form">
    <div class="ref-form-section__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Apply to become a partner</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">We'll review your application and reach out within 48 hours.</p>

      <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
        <div class="ref-success">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          <div>
            <strong>Application received!</strong>
            <p>We'll review your application and get back to you within 48 hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
          <div class="form-error"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form class="ref-form" method="POST" action="/referral">
          <div class="form-row form-row--two">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Your Name <span class="required">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Greg Patterson"
                value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.name ? values.name : '' %>">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email Address <span class="required">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="greg@ozarkoutfitters.com"
                value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.email ? values.email : '' %>">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row form-row--two">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="website">Website / Social Handle <span class="required">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="website" name="website" required placeholder="@ozarkoutfitters or your site URL"
                value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.website ? values.website : '' %>">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="promotion_method">How will you promote OzarkRoost? <span class="required">*</span></label>
              <select id="promotion_method" name="promotion_method" required>
                <option value="">Select one…</option>
                <option value="social_media" <%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.promotion_method === 'social_media') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Social media / Content</option>
                <option value="email_newsletter" <%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.promotion_method === 'email_newsletter') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Email newsletter</option>
                <option value="website_blog" <%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.promotion_method === 'website_blog') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Website or blog</option>
                <option value="referral_network" <%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.promotion_method === 'referral_network') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Operator referral network</option>
                <option value="other" <%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.promotion_method === 'other') ? 'selected' : '' %>>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Anything else you'd like us to know?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Tell us about your audience and how you plan to promote OzarkRoost."><%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.message) ? values.message : '' %></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="ref-form__footer">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Submit Application</button>
            <p class="ref-form__note">No spam. We'll only contact you about your application status.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="ref-faq">
    <div class="ref-faq__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Common questions</h2>
      <div class="ref-faq__items">
        <details class="ref-faq__item">
          <summary>When do I get paid?</summary>
          <p>Affiliate commissions are paid monthly, 30 days after the booking is completed. Referral fees are paid 30 days after your referred operator's first payment clears.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="ref-faq__item">
          <summary>Is there a minimum payout threshold?</summary>
          <p>Payments are sent when your balance reaches $50. If your balance is below $50, it carries over to the next month.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="ref-faq__item">
          <summary>What if my referred operator cancels?</summary>
          <p>Referral fees are non-refundable once paid. Affiliate commissions are only paid on completed bookings — no commission on cancellations or refunds.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="ref-faq__item">
          <summary>Can I promote OzarkRoost on paid ads?</summary>
          <p>No — our program does not allow paid advertising on behalf of OzarkRoost. Organic content, SEO, email, and social media are all encouraged.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="ref-faq__item">
          <summary>How is the commission calculated?</summary>
          <p>Commission is calculated on the total booking value (excluding taxes and fees). Rates vary by booking source — Vrbo bookings typically earn 3–5%, direct bookings 6–8%.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>